  seoTitle="Rheumatoid arthritis & melanocortins: the resolution bet"
  kicker="The condition"
  description="Rheumatoid arthritis is inflammation that never gets the signal to stop. Melanocortin receptors on immune cells are part of the body's own off-switch, and an oral drug built on that idea has now been through a mid-stage trial — with a result that is neither the win its backers wanted nor a clean failure."
  seoDescription="Rheumatoid arthritis is inflammation that fails to resolve. MC1R and MC3R on immune cells are part of the off-switch — and a Phase 2b trial tested it."
