>
  <KeyTakeaways
    items={[
      'Rheumatoid arthritis is a chronic autoimmune disease in which inflammation of the joint lining persists and, untreated, destroys cartilage and bone.',
      'The melanocortin angle is resolution: MC1R and MC3R on immune cells help run the body’s own programme for ending an inflammatory response.',
      'Resomelagon (AP1189) is an oral agonist of those two receptors, designed as a biased agonist to avoid the pigment pathway.',
